%% Dashboard Usage Statistics
%% Pie chart showing page views distribution across the BI platform dashboards.
%% Cube Insights Overview is the most visited at 35%.
%% Used to evaluate dashboard adoption and prioritize feature development.

---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    pie1: "#2563eb"
    pie2: "#3b82f6"
    pie3: "#60a5fa"
    pie4: "#93c5fd"
    pie5: "#bfdbfe"
    pie6: "#dbeafe"
---
pie showData
    title Dashboard Page Views Distribution
    "Cube Insights Overview" : 35
    "Territory Map" : 20
    "Product Insights" : 18
    "DW Dashboard" : 15
    "Employee Performance" : 7
    "Promotions" : 5
